# Supabase platform (DG Yard Connect)

Read and follow **`.cursor/skills/dgyard-supabase/SKILL.md`** for all Supabase work.

## Must do
- Schema changes → new file in `supabase/migrations/` then **`npx supabase db push`** or **`npm run deploy:supabase`** (from `scripts/`).
- Update `supabase/SCHEMA.md` when tables/columns change.
- Never replace Firebase Auth; never migrate Firestore Connect data.
- Shared identity: `firebase_uid` = Firebase Auth UID.

## Must not do
- Manual-only SQL Editor steps unless CLI fails (then document why).
- Edit `features/marketplace/` Firestore code for new Shop features (use `features/shop/` + Supabase).
- Break existing auth, jobs, or billing flows.

## Quick commands
```bash
cd scripts && npm run deploy:supabase
npx supabase db push
powershell -File scripts/supabase-new-migration.ps1 -Name "your_change"
```

User prompt examples: `supabase/PROMPTS.md`
